# Copy this to pi/.env on the Pi and fill in real values.
# pi/.env is gitignored.

# Discogs personal access token (https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers)
# Recommended — token enables the full album-context layer (track/album/
# tracklist metadata, side timer, album-locked recognition, BEST GUESS card,
# sticky disambiguation). Without it, the kiosk falls back to a Shazam-only
# display (artist + title + album + cover art from Apple's CDN) and loses
# every tracklist-dependent feature. Leave as `replace_me` (or unset) to run
# without it.
DISCOGS_TOKEN=replace_me

# Optional: pin a specific Sonos zone by name. If unset, the listener uses
# the only coordinator it discovers, or fails loudly if multiple exist.
# SONOS_ZONE_NAME=Office

# Optional: Last.fm scrobbling. When all three are set, confirmed tracks
# auto-scrobble to your Last.fm profile (>=30s tracks, >=50% played or >=240s).
# Create API credentials at https://www.last.fm/api/account/create then
# run `python3 pi/scripts/lastfm_auth.py` once to bootstrap a session key.
# Leave blank to disable — orchestrator runs normally without these.
# LASTFM_API_KEY=
# LASTFM_API_SECRET=
# LASTFM_SESSION_KEY=

# Optional: override the kiosk webserver bind addr/port. The systemd unit and
# all skills/scripts assume the defaults (0.0.0.0:8080). Only set these if
# you need to run on a non-default port or bind to a specific interface.
# NP_HOST=0.0.0.0
# NP_PORT=8080

# Optional: Anthropic API key activates LLM-assisted decisions (Haiku 4.5)
# at four cascade decision points: cover/tribute filter, end-of-side advance,
# /identify release ranker, and fingerprint promotion gate. Without the key,
# all four hooks fall back to today's hardcoded heuristics — orchestrator
# runs identically. Install the SDK with: uv sync --extra llm
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: enable the local-fingerprint cascade. When "true", the orchestrator
# passively trains a fingerprint DB from Shazam-confirmed clips and uses it to
# identify tracks Shazam misses on previously-played albums (B-sides, segues,
# deep cuts). Without it, the cascade falls back to tracklist-aware advancement
# on Shazam miss. Install the deps with: uv sync --extra fingerprint
# FINGERPRINT_ENABLED=false
